#. TRANSLATORS: Shown when a Chromecast or other device the user picks
#. can't get its music from Clementine's network remote: the remote is
#. on, but couldn't open its port, usually because another program has
#. it. %1 is the device's name; %2 is the port number, such as 5500.
#: networkremote/streaming/rendererregistry.cpp:571
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"%1 gets its music from Clementine through the network remote, which couldn't"
" listen on port %2. Another program may be using it."
msgstr "%1 obtiene su música de Clementine mediante el mando a distancia de red, que no pudo escuchar en el puerto %2. Es posible que otro programa lo esté usando."

#. TRANSLATORS: Shown when a Chromecast or other device the user picks
#. can't get its music from Clementine's network remote: the remote only
#. listens on addresses the user chose (Settings, Network Remote), and
#. none is on the device's network. %1 is the device's name.
#: networkremote/streaming/rendererregistry.cpp:582
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"%1 gets its music from Clementine through the network remote, which doesn't "
"listen on an address in %1's network."
msgstr "%1 obtiene su música de Clementine mediante el mando a distancia de red, que no escucha en una dirección de la red de %1."

#. TRANSLATORS: Shown when the user picks a Chromecast or other device
#. to play on, and it can't get the music. Such devices download the
#. audio from Clementine through the network remote, the server the
#. phone remote apps also connect to (Settings, Network Remote). %1 is
#. the device's name, such as "Living Room TV".
#: networkremote/streaming/rendererregistry.cpp:563
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"%1 gets its music from Clementine through the network remote, which is "
"turned off."
msgstr "%1 obtiene su música de Clementine mediante el mando a distancia de red, que está desactivado."

#. TRANSLATORS: Shown when a Chromecast or other device the user picks
#. can't get its music from Clementine's network remote: the remote's
#. "Only allow connections from the local network" setting refuses it,
#. since its address isn't a private one. %1 is the device's name.
#: networkremote/streaming/rendererregistry.cpp:590
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"%1 gets its music from Clementine through the network remote, which only "
"allows connections from the local network, and %1 isn't on it."
msgstr "%1 obtiene su música de Clementine mediante el mando a distancia de red, que solo permite conexiones desde la red local, y %1 no forma parte de ella."

